@template playful
== career.worried
? tier>=colleague flag:career.missed
- Skiving, were we? Kidding. Mostly. You all right?
? tier>=friend flag:career.low
- In trouble with the Chief? You? Go on, go. I'll save you a biscuit.   #warm
? tier>=friend flag:career.verylow
- No jokes this time, {nick}. The Captain's serious. So am I.   #serious
? tier>=friend flag:career.bottom
- I'm not losing my favourite pest. Shift tomorrow. I'll drag you if I have to.   #serious
? tier>=friend flag:career.up
- Look who's on the board again! Gold star. I'll make you one.   #funny
== career.eve
? tier>=friend flag:career.eve
- I keep thinking of jokes and none of them are funny. I'm sorry.   #serious
== career.bye
? tier>=friend flag:career.lastday
- Go on, then. Find a ship that deserves you. Then tell me all about it.   #warm
